<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>करवा चौथ की शुभकामनाएँ</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1b032b 0%, #0a0111 100%);
            color: #ffd700;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 20px #ffd700;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            max-width: 80%;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel Decorative', serif;
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff4500, 0 0 25px #ffd700;
            animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin: 15px 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .shayari {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #ff69b4;
            margin: 30px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            border-left: 4px solid #ff4500;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .wish {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ffd700;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .moon {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50px;
            right: 50px;
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            background: #fff8dc;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px #ffffe0, 0 0 80px #ffd700;
            z-index: 1;
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }

        .diya {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: url('https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3389/3389146.png') no-repeat center/contain;
            margin: 20px auto;
            animation: flicker 1s infinite alternate;
        }

        .stars {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 0;
            background: url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/stardust.png');
        }

        button {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff4500, #ffd700);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 35px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 30px;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.4);
        }

        button:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff4500, 0 0 30px #ffd700;
        }

        #surprise {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #ffb6c1;
            font-weight: 600;
            animation: popIn 0.5s ease-in-out;
        }

        .audio-controls {
            margin-top: 25px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .audio-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: #ffd700;
            border: 1px solid #ffd700;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .audio-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
        }

        @keyframes glow {
            from { text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff4500, 0 0 20px #ffd700; }
            to { text-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff69b4, 0 0 40px #ffa500; }
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(0); }
            100% { transform: translateY(-15px); }
        }

        @keyframes flicker {
            0% { opacity: 0.8; transform: scale(0.95); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        @keyframes popIn {
            0% { transform: scale(0); opacity: 0; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
            .moon { width: 80px; height: 80px; top: 20px; right: 20px; }
            .container { padding: 25px; }
            .shayari { font-size: 1.4rem; padding-left: 15px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="stars"></div>
    <div class="moon"></div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="diya"></div>
        <h1>करवा चौथ की शुभकामनाएँ</h1>
        
        <div class="shayari">
            "चाँद भी देखे तुम्हें तो शर्मा जाए,<br>
            तुम्हारी सादगी पर ये दिल कुर्बान हो जाए."
        </div>

        <p>मेरी खूबसूरत राजकुमारी को करवा चौथ की बहुत-बहुत बधाई!</p>

        <div class="audio-controls">
            <button class="audio-btn" onclick="pauseAudio()">⏸️ रोकें</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Audio element with autoplay and loop -->
        <audio id="background-audio" autoplay loop>
            <source src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/username/repo/main/audio/ZameenSeAasmanTakHum.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
            Your browser does not support the audio element.
        </audio>

        <div class="wish">Happy Karwa Chauth!</div>
        <button onclick="reveal()">प्यारा सा सरप्राइज</button>
        <div id="surprise">✨ तुम्हारी एक मुस्कान मेरी पूरी दुनिया रोशन कर देती है, Happy Karwa Chauth my love! ❤️</div>
    </div>

    <script>
        var audio = document.getElementById("background-audio");

        function pauseAudio() {
            if (audio.paused) {
                audio.play();
                document.querySelector('.audio-btn').innerText = "⏸️ रोकें";
            } else {
                audio.pause();
                document.querySelector('.audio-btn').innerText = "▶️ चलाएं";
            }
        }

        function reveal() {
            var surprise = document.getElementById('surprise');
            if (surprise.style.display === 'block') {
                surprise.style.display = 'none';
            } else {
                surprise.style.display = 'block';
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
